{"c":{"36309":["Narrator",null,"b36309-6KM0riV4lqfN.jpg","This character page is set to represent and list all narrators, which haven't been given a visual representation of themselves in their respective work.",2200],"76710":["Toshinari Seki",null,"76710-lXJukTIohhVK.jpg","Toshinari Seki, referred by his surname Seki, is one of the main characters. He is always seen playing games at his desk, from intermediate to near impossible, though he never seems to study. Seki has short black hair, green eyes, and is somewhat enigmatic.",153],"76714":["Rumi Yokoi","Female","b76714-sDLvhCLASzsp.png","Yokoi is a girl who sits next to Seki-kun. She always tries to avoid Seki-kun's weird and interesting behaviors, but she unwillingly concerns herself with them anyway.",137],"169142":["Sakurako Gotou",null,"b169142-DuOU04darUUz.jpg","Sakurako Gotou sits near Rumi and Seki during art class and becomes Rumi's friend. She assumes Seki and Rumi are lovers because of the way they interact in class.",4],"185709":["Rika no Sensei",null,"b185709-74wfXoswk0Nn.png","",0],"185710":["Oushou",null,"b185710-cs48L0YofrlF.png","",0],"185711":["Bijutsu no Sensei",null,"b185711-u9IfIetsGZ2d.jpg","",0],"185712":["Akiyasu Uzawa",null,"b185712-sgVEC9duH4TB.jpg","",0],"185713":["Ongaku no Sensei",null,"b185713-ehlzeifY0Xkz.png","",0],"185714":["Yokoi-san no Haha",null,"b185714-dKGzKz8SOPIy.png","",0],"185715":["Tenchou",null,"b185715-yAGSo9CimGyX.png","",0],"185716":["Shokuin",null,"b185716-L8fMOc6uY77U.png","",0],"185717":["Suugaku no Sensei",null,"b185717-IR3Oow8w2amy.png","",0],"185718":["Adachi-sensei",null,"b185718-M6WJwGKmdJj6.jpg","",0],"185719":["Kinshou",null,"b185719-r4ulsUZ44hOy.png","",0],"185720":["Robot (Ko)",null,"b185720-I6c7tEtS3jOW.png","",1],"185721":["Robot (Chichi)",null,"b185721-9OQdQwAYLvmi.png","",2],"185722":["Takahiro Maeda",null,"b185722-BUaeeveOsEOa.jpg","",0],"185723":["Tomoka Hashino",null,"b185723-lgmZh4bXxmhW.jpg","",1],"185724":["Taiiku no Sensei",null,"b185724-ef2NpjaT